OL,3,GNEWSALake victim's family welcome
OL,4,Asafety measures
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a teenager who drowned in
OL,7,Fa lake have welcomed safety measures
OL,8,Fdesigned to make the area less
OL,9,Fappealing to swimmers.
OL,11,FIn May, 15-year-old Declan Sawyer died
OL,12,Fat Swanholme Lakes in Lincoln.
OL,14,FAnother boy, Iretomiwa Abiodun Micheal
OL,15,F` known as Tomiwa ` died at the same
OL,16,Flocation in July.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
