OL,3,GNEWSALake victim's family welcome
OL,4,Asafety measures
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe new safety measures include
OL,7,Fplanting gorse and bramble across the
OL,8,Fsandy beach areas to discourage people
OL,9,Ffrom going into the water, and City of
OL,10,FLincoln Council is looking at whether a
OL,11,Flayer of clay could be put over the
OL,12,Fsand to make it less attractive.
